<mxCell id="rules_note" value="&lt;b&gt;KEY BUSINESS RULES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Customer selects facility and unit type; the exact unit is assigned when the rental contract is created.&lt;br&gt;2. No overlapping active contract or maintenance period for the same unit.&lt;br&gt;3. Renewal begins from the current contract end date; update end_date only after successful payment.&lt;br&gt;4. Only one active renewal and one active termination request per contract.&lt;br&gt;5. facility_id NULL in RENTAL_POLICIES means system-wide policy.&lt;br&gt;6. USER_FACILITY_ASSIGNMENTS applies to both Facility Staff and Facility Manager.&lt;br&gt;7. UQ* means UNIQUE(facility_id, unit_number). Login/logout events are stored in ACTIVITY_LOGS." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2490" y="1030" width="420" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend" value="PK = Primary Key | FK = Foreign Key | UQ = Unique | NULL = Optional | Crow's Foot = Cardinality" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="2300" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
